  "content": "<p>這是一個為 <em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/iron-furnaces\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iron Furnaces</a></em> 模組設計的資源包，由 <span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><a style=\"color:#e67e23\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/xenomustache\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">XenoMustache</a></span> 製作。它將升級後的熔爐紋理改為帶有邊框的樣式，而非由整塊材質方塊構成。</p>\n<p>以下是對比圖：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_2a3ec870-23c5-4b0a-b35a-c70a752d558e.png\"></p>",
